a guest. To avoid losing your order info, please log in and link your account now.\"},\"paySuccessModal\":{\"bindNow\":\"Link Now\",\"vipTitle\":\"Congratulations! You are now a VIP member!\",\"vipDesc\":\"Download NetShort and log in to watch 2,000+ premium dramas, experience HD streaming, and explore more exclusive content and features!\",\"rechargeSuccessTitle\":\"Congratulations! Your top-up was successful!\",\"rechargeSuccessDownloadAfterConsume\":\"Payment Successful! Download NetShort \u0026 log in to continue watching.\",\"rechargeSuccessDownloadWithBalance\":\"Payment Successful! Download NetShort \u0026 log in to use your coins for more content.\"},\"unlockEpisode\":\"Unlock This Episode\",\"payModal\":{\"rechargeInstructions\":\"Top-up Policy\",\"rechargeContent_1\":\"1. Membership benefits, coins, and bonus obtained from top-ups can be used to unlock paid content within the NetShort app.\",\"rechargeContent_2\":\"2. You may top up for yourself or for another user with a known UID; after payment, membership benefits or coins and bonus will be automatically credited to the designated account.\",\"rechargeContent_3\":\"3. Bonus will expire after a specified period; please check the expiration date in \\\"My Wallet\\\".\",\"rechargeContent_4\":\"4. Subscription promotions take effect within 24 hours after purchase, depending on your payment status. The system will automatically charge your account based on your selected plan within 24 hours before the current subscription ends.\",\"rechargeContent_5\":\"5. Once payment is successful, your subscription will automatically renew. To cancel auto-renewal, please do so in Profile at least 24 hours in advance.\",\"rechargeContent_6\":\"6. If you have any questions, please contact us via email promptly.\",\"rechargeContent_7\":\"By purchasing coins or subscribing, you agree to our Terms of Service; payments will be processed securely.\",\"membershipAgreement\":\"Membership Agreement\",\"paymentAgreement\":\"Payment Agreement\",\"privacyAgreement\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"price\":\"Price\",\"balance\":\"Balance\",\"toPay\":\"Proceed to Payment\",\"subscriptionAutoRenewDesc\":\"Auto-renews, cancel anytime\",\"subscriptionPriceWeek\":\"{x1}/week for the first {x2} weeks, then {x3}/week\",\"subscriptionPriceMonth\":\"{x1}/month for the first {x2} months, then {x3}/month\",\"subscriptionPriceQuarter\":\"{x1}/season for the first {x2} seasons, then {x3}/season\",\"subscriptionPriceYear\":\"{x1}/year for the first {x2} years, then {x3}/year\",\"cardPaySheetTitle\":\"Pay with debit or credit card\",\"chooseTip\":\"Select Payment Method\",\"pay\":\"Pay\",\"cardPay\":\"Card Payment\"},\"payFailedModal\":{\"title\":\"Payment Failed\",\"desc\":\"Sorry, please try again\",\"tryAgain\":\"Retry\",\"back\":\"Back\"},\"lockPopDownload\":{\"getButton\":\"Get\",\"description\":\"Watch paid episodes in the app\"},\"browserUnsupportedCover\":\"Recommended to watch using Chrome browser\",\"episodeList\":\"Episode List\",\"synopsis\":\"Synopsis\"},\"expired_tip_text\":\"Short drama removed\",\"downloadPopup\":{\"text\":\"Scan the QR code to get NetShort and start binging.\",\"closeAria\":\"Off\",\"ariaLabel\":\"Download the NetShort App\"},\"user\":{\"reportThankYou\":\"Report submitted\",\"report\":\"Report\",\"expirationTime\":\"Expiration Date: {xx}/{xx}/{xx}\",\"autoRenewal\":\"Auto-Renewal\",\"disableAutoRenewalConfirmBtn\":\"Confirm\",\"disableAutoRenewalCancelBtn\":\"Cancel\",\"activate\":\"Subscribe\",\"title\":\"Profile\",\"titleNotLoggedIn\":\"Profile – Not Logged In\",\"autoRenewalCancelTip\":\"Notice: To cancel your subscription, please turn off auto-renewal at least 24 hours in advance.\",\"disableAutoRenewalTitle\":\"Turn Off Auto-Renewal\",\"disableAutoRenewalConfirmContent\":\"Confirm turning off auto-renewal? You will no longer be charged automatically\",\"disableAutoRenewalSuccess\":\"Auto-renewal has been turned off\",\"disableAutoRenewalFail\":\"Failed. Please try again later\",\"netshortVip\":\"NetShort VIP\",\"enjoyExclusiveBenefits\":\"Exclusive VIP Benefits\",\"active\":\"Activated\",\"vipCancelTimeLabel\":\"Auto-Renewal Cancellation Date\",\"renewalManagement\":\"Subscription Management\",\"reportPlaceholder\":\"Enter here.\",\"reporting\":\"Submitting report...\"},\"short_search_title\":\"You're searching for \u003cname\u003e\u003c/name\u003e. Here are some picks for you:\",\"short_search_desc\":\"Browse the short dramas related to \u003cname\u003e\u003c/name\u003e and find the one for you. Every plot detail is crafted, paired with outstanding performances, to bring you an immersive cinematic experience. Explore the selection below to discover the unique charm of short dramas and enjoy a captivating feast!\",\"short_search_seo_desc\":\"Welcome to NetShort! We've picked a collection of {search_name} short dramas just for you. Top {search_name} hits include {short_name1}, {short_name2}, and {short_name3}. Packed with twists, totally addictive. Binge away!\",\"short_search_seo_title\":\"{search_name} -All Episodes Free - NetShort\",\"cookie\":{\"banner\":{\"title\":\"Your privacy matters\",\"description\":\"We use cookies to improve your browsing experience, analyse traffic, and provide relevant content. You can accept all cookies, reject non-essential cookies, or manage your cookie settings. For more information, please read our \u003ccookiePolicy\u003eCookie Policy\u003c/cookiePolicy\u003e.\",\"cookieSettings\":\"Cookie Settings\",\"rejectAll\":\"Reject All\",\"acceptAll\":\"Accept All\",\"closeAria\":\"Close\"},\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Privacy Overview\",\"intro\":\"This website uses only essential cookies to ensure proper functionality and a smooth browsing experience. These cookies are stored in your browser and are necessary for the basic operations of the site. No non-essential or third-party cookies are used.\",\"categories\":{\"necessary\":\"Necessary\",\"functionality\":\"Functionality\",\"analytics\":\"Analytics\",\"advertising\":\"Advertising\",\"functional\":\"Functionality\"},\"categoryDescriptions\":{\"necessary\":\"Cookies used to: - determine whether the user has accepted the cookies consent box; - register whether or not the user has viewed the website's privacy policy; - distinguish between humans and bots (robots).\",\"functionality\":\"Functional cookies help perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on social media platforms, collecting feedback, and other third-party features.\",\"analytics\":\"Cookies used to analyze website traffic and understand how visitors interact with the site. These cookies are disabled until the user gives their consent.\",\"advertising\":\"Cookies used to deliver personalized advertisements and measure the effectiveness of advertising campaigns. These cookies are disabled until the user gives their consent.\"},\"alwaysActive\":\"Always Active\",\"table\":{\"cookie\":\"Cookie\",\"duration\":\"Duration\",\"description\":\"Description\"},\"cookies\":{\"GRECAPTCHA\":{\"duration\":\"6 months\",\"description\":\"Google Recaptcha service sets this cookie to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks.\"}},\"acceptAll\":\"Accept All\",\"closeAria\":\"Close\"}},\"deleteAccount\":{\"entry\":\"Delete account\",\"instructions\":{\"title\":\"Account Deletion Instructions\",\"item1\":\"Before you decide to delete your account, please carefully read the following instructions to ensure that you fully understand the consequences of account deletion.\",\"item2\":\"Account Deletion Is Irreversible: Once you confirm the deletion of your account, your account and all related information will be permanently removed and cannot be recovered.\\nPlease proceed with caution.\",\"item3\":\"Data Erasure: After your account is deleted, the following information will be permanently erased and cannot be restored: personal data; third-party account information; purchase history, including top-up history, episode unlock history, and series in My List; and account balance, including Coins and bonus VIP benefits.\",\"item4\":\"Auto-Renewing VIP Subscription: If you have purchased an auto-renewing VIP subscription and your account currently has VIP status, deleting your account will be considered a voluntary forfeiture of your VIP benefits. To avoid further charges, please cancel your subscription through the Google Play Store or the Apple App Store before deleting your account. NetShort will not be responsible for any continued charges resulting from failure to cancel the subscription.\",\"consent\":\"I accept all risks associated with deleting my account and agree to its deletion.\",\"acceptAll\":\"Accept all\"},\"confirm\":{\"title\":\"Confirm Account Deletion\",\"confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\"},\"successModal\":{\"description\":\"Your account has been deleted, and all related information has been permanently removed from our system. If you wish to continue using NetShort, please reopen the app or visit the website.\",\"tryAgain\":\"Try again\"}},\"short_search_longtail\":\"Related Searches\",\"allepisodes\":{\"title\":\"Full Episodes, Full Movies \u0026 Good Web Series on NetShort\"},\"faq\":{\"meta\":{\"title\":\"NetShort FAQ\",\"description\":\"Answers about NetShort short dramas, micro dramas, reels shorts, watching series online, HD, downloads, and support.\"},\"h1\":{\"title\":\"FAQ\"},\"q1\":{\"question\":\"What is NetShort?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"NetShort is a place to watch \u003clink\u003eshort dramas\u003c/link\u003e and micro dramas online — including NetShort originals and officially licensed series. Think binge-friendly short reels and reels shorts, not a random dump of full-length films. You can watch on our website or grab the \u003clink2\u003eNetShort app\u003c/link2\u003e on Android and iOS.\"}},\"q2\":{\"question\":\"Are NetShort episodes free to watch?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"A lot of episodes are free to start. Early episodes on many series are unlocked at no cost; later ones may need coins, a subscription, ads, or VIP. So yes — you can \u003clink\u003ewatch series online\u003c/link\u003e for free in many cases, while premium unlocks help you finish trending titles without stopping halfway.\"}},\"q3\":{\"question\":\"Where can I watch NetShort dramas?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"Wherever’s easiest for you. On a computer, go to \u003chome\u003enetshort.com\u003c/home\u003e; on your phone browser, use \u003cwebMobile\u003eweb.shortnivo.com\u003c/webMobile\u003e. Prefer an app? \u003cdownload\u003eDownload NetShort\u003c/download\u003e for iOS or Android. That’s the simplest way to watch series online, keep your list, and pick up where you left off.\"}},\"q4\":{\"question\":\"Are your dramas available in multiple languages?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"Yes — we support 17 languages, including English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Arabic, Portuguese, Italian, German, French, Turkish, Malay, Vietnamese, and Hindi. Each version has localized \u003callPlots\u003eshort dramas\u003c/allPlots\u003e and short videos; audio and subtitles can still vary by title and region.\"}},\"q5\":{\"question\":\"Can I watch NetShort dramas in 1080p HD quality?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"Yes. On web and in the \u003cdownload\u003eapp\u003c/download\u003e you can stream in crisp 1080p HD — great when you want that “\u003chotseries\u003egood web series\u003c/hotseries\u003e / HD” feel on a bigger screen. HD playback is available for VIP members so the picture stays clear whether you’re on short reels or a longer binge.\"}},\"q6\":{\"question\":\"How often are new short dramas and episodes released?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"Pretty often. We add new \u003callEpisodes\u003eshort dramas\u003c/allEpisodes\u003e, \u003chotseries\u003eexclusive titles\u003c/hotseries\u003e, and fresh episodes on a regular basis, so there’s usually something new if you like short series, micro dramas, or quick reels shorts between tasks.\"}},\"q7\":{\"question\":\"Can I download episodes to watch offline?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"Usually in the \u003cdownload\u003eNetShort app\u003c/download\u003e (not always on the website). Open a series in the app and look for download if that title and your account support it — handy when you want short videos or full episode packs without relying on Wi‑Fi.\"}},\"q8\":{\"question\":\"How can businesses partner with NetShort for content creation?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"We work with creators, studios, and brands on micro dramas production, IP licensing, and brand integrations — including watch the originals-style \u003chotseries\u003eNetShort Exclusive\u003c/hotseries\u003e projects. Reach out through the partnership contacts on our \u003chome\u003ewebsite\u003c/home\u003e and tell us what you’re building.\"}},\"q9\":{\"question\":\"How do I get help or report a problem?\",\"answer\":{\"aHtml\":\"Fastest option: in-app profile feedback. Or email the \u003csupport\u003esupport addresses\u003c/support\u003e in the website footer. Include your NetShort ID or registered email, device, app version, and a short description of what went wrong (page URL helps too if you were trying to \u003callEpisodes\u003ewatch series online\u003c/allEpisodes\u003e).\"}}}},\"children\":\"$L14\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"14:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"isPcLayout\":true,\"userAgent\":\"DramadexBot/0.1 (self-hosted metadata indexer)\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[\"$L17\",[]],\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}]\nc:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-s