0980782421671938\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Crushing The Village Bully\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Crushing The Village Bully\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/crushing-the-village-bully-2090980782421671938\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/crushing-the-village-bully-2090980782421671938\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090980780014141441/1787552403219-1281685474716605-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"During a deadly drought, a ruthless local bully cuts off the village's only water supply just to farm crabs! While the desperate villagers beg for mercy, a mysterious hero makes a badass return. Refusing to back down, he steps up to crush the arrogant bully, reclaim their lifeline, and restore ultimate justice!\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832035849748482\",\"labelName\":\"Good vs. Evil\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Good%20vs.%20Evil-1983832035849748482\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832035958800386\",\"labelName\":\"Inheritance Battle\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Inheritance%20Battle-1983832035958800386\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036969627650\",\"labelName\":\"Rural Life\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Rural%20Life-1983832036969627650\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090980411771027457\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090980414908366849\",\"shortPlayName\":\"That's My House!\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"That's My House!\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/thats-my-house-2090980414908366849\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/thats-my-house-2090980414908366849\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090980411771027457/1787552920338-2512705420596164-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"A woman drains her savings to build a house for her fiancé's family, only to discover the deeds are registered under his brother's name. They assume she will accept it. She collects the receipts, calls the trucks, and on the day of the engagement, she tears down the gates.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092975554563\",\"labelName\":\"Romantic Marriage\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Romantic%20Marriage-1983832092975554563\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092950388739\",\"labelName\":\"Female Empowerment\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Female%20Empowerment-1983832092950388739\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090978270394286082\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090978272910868481\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Athena：Medusa, love me once more\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Athena：Medusa, love me once more\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/athenamedusa-love-me-once-more-2090978272910868481\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/athenamedusa-love-me-once-more-2090978272910868481\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090978270394286082/1787559101891-4062970507392603-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Driven by hatred for Athena, who cursed her into a serpent, Medusa is cast into the mortal world with her, one forgetting, one remembering. When Medusa's memories return, she seeks revenge but falls for Athena instead. As the truth behind the curse emerges, Poseidon's wrath forces them to face a final choice.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092417712131\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy%20Romance-1983832092417712131\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091029397505\",\"labelName\":\"Wish-Fulfillment\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Wish-Fulfillment-1983832091029397505\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832090932928513\",\"labelName\":\"Alternate History\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Alternate%20History-1983832090932928513\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2089638351519547394\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2089638355348946946\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Widow at the Night Market\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Widow at the Night Market\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/widow-at-the-night-market-2089638355348946946\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/widow-at-the-night-market-2089638355348946946\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2089638351519547394/1787544748117-9859219338803981-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Bullied at the Night Market, Wendy Lynn must keep her sick Mother-in-law and young daughter alive. When ruthless vendor Clara Chang tries to drive her out, Wendy Lynn fights back and turns a tiny stall into a hit shop. Shaw stays by her side even after she rejects him, but just as she’s about to turn things around, Clara Chang makes her next move.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091864064002\",\"labelName\":\"Slow-Burn Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Slow-Burn%20Romance-1983832091864064002\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092950388739\",\"labelName\":\"Female Empowerment\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Female%20Empowerment-1983832092950388739\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091347977610063874\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091347980437024769\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Love in disloyalty\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Love in disloyalty\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/love-in-disloyalty-2091347980437024769\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/love-in-disloyalty-2091347980437024769\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2091347977610063874/1787566926154-7554117153375707-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"A man who loved his best friend's wife for years finally gets his chance when she discovers her husband's infidelity. One night of revenge turns into a secret affair that neither can walk away from. She started as a friend's wife. She became his reason to stay.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832090844848130\",\"labelName\":\"Modern\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern-1983832090844848130\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091347339606085634\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091347342122668034\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Addicted to My CEO Doctor\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Addicted to My CEO Doctor\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/addicted-to-my-ceo-doctor-2091347342122668034\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/addicted-to-my-ceo-doctor-2091347342122668034\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2091347339606085634/1787565417138-5643692207909003-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Neglected by her husband who loves her sister, a lonely wife develops a secret condition. She seeks help from a handsome doctor, only to find out he is her new billionaire boss! As he fiercely protects her from her toxic family's wicked schemes, their private office sessions turn into a forbidden romance. Will she leave her terrible marriage?\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092950388739\",\"labelName\":\"Female Empowerment\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Female%20Empowerment-1983832092950388739\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090980020610236417\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090980023906959362\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Return Of The Tyrant's Dead Crush\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Return Of The Tyrant's Dead Crush\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/return-of-the-tyrants-dead-crush-2090980023906959362\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/return-of-the-tyrants-dead-crush-2090980023906959362\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090980020610236417/1787560571190-9061439165050986-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"She transmigrated into a novel as the only woman beside a tyrant. Her mission: become his white moonlight. She taught him to love, then left. The system failed. It sent her three years into the future. The tyrant she taught to love has learned a new lesson: how to hate. Can she survive the heart she created?\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092962971651\",\"labelName\":\"Historical Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Historical%20Romance-1983832092962971651\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092468043778\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy-1983832092468043778\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092174442499\",\"labelName\":\"Trapped in a Book\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Trapped%20in%20a%20Book-1983832092174442499\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090979531348869121\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090979534293270529\",\"shortPlayName\":\"My Ex Is an Alpha, My Future Is a King\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"My Ex Is an Alpha, My Future Is a King\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/my-ex-is-an-alpha-my-future-is-a-king-2090979534293270529\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/my-ex-is-an-alpha-my-future-is-a-king-2090979534293270529\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090979531348869121/1787567438191-6881346965498211-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"When the Duke dies, Cordelia’s uncle steals the title and fortune, leaving her blind and powerless. To protect her lover Luke, she breaks his heart and sends him away. Years later, Luke returns as Duke Luciano, a feared war hero seeking revenge. But as the truth unfolds, hatred turns into a love he can’t resist.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092417712131\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy%20Romance-1983832092417712131\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832090991648770\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy World\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy%20World-1983832090991648770\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090979073104384002\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090979075608383490\",\"shortPlayName\":\"THE PRODIGY RETURNS\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"THE PRODIGY RETURNS\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-prodigy-returns-2090979075608383490\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-prodigy-returns-2090979075608383490\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090979073104384002/1787568483228-4733641097153223-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Reborn after being betrayed and killed by her own family, Ada returns to expose her adopted sister Camilla, who stole her genius and used mind-reading powers to cheat. Once a neglected daughter, Ada now fights back, reclaiming her honor and proving herself as the world’s greatest math prodigy.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090978662385553410\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090978664860192770\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Fleeing The Future I Saw With Him \",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Fleeing The Future I Saw With Him \",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/fleeing-the-future-i-saw-with-him-2090978664860192770\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/fleeing-the-future-i-saw-with-him-2090978664860192770\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090978662385553410/1787562481210-1637585511241655-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"A girl with future vision sees herself kissing her arrogant, cold student council president. She tries to avoid him, only for him to become her stepbrother overnight. Every vision comes true, and every step brings her closer to the future she was never supposed to want. \",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092392546307\",\"labelName\":\"Fake Siblings\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fake%20Siblings-1983832092392546307\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832093059440642\",\"labelName\":\"Campus Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Campus%20Romance-1983832093059440642\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092468043778\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy-1983832092468043778\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090977726967676930\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090977730113404930\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Furless One\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Furless One\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-furless-one-2090977730113404930\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-furless-one-2090977730113404930\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090977726967676930/1787560944340-4028329442558254-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Framed by her pack, Leila was thrown into the Howling Chasm and lost her arm. Two years later, her cruel family forces her to marry the North's rumored \\\"mad wolf\\\", Darian. But Darian is not mad, he is her fiercest protector. When her grandmother reveals that Leila is the true Alpha's daughter, the impostor's schemes collapse...\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091792760834\",\"labelName\":\"Plot Twist\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Plot%20Twist-1983832091792760834\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092153470979\",\"labelName\":\"Werewolf\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Werewolf-1983832092153470979\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092417712131\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy%20Romance-1983832092417712131\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090259073007632385\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090259075922673665\",\"shortPlayName\":\"THE BILLIONAIRE WHO OWED ME EVERYTHING\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"THE BILLIONAIRE WHO OWED ME EVERYTHING\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-billionaire-who-owed-me-everything-2090259075922673665\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-billionaire-who-owed-me-everything-2090259075922673665\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2090259073007632385/1787560324395-5304962620403955-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"After her ex steals her designs and erases her name, talented patternmaker Maya Bennett gets a second chance from billionaire CEO Evelyn Vaughan. Refusing to be controlled, Maya fights to reclaim her identity and rise as a designer. But when a family conspiracy threatens them, Maya and Evelyn must fight together and choose their own destiny.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092950388739\",\"labelName\":\"Female Empowerment\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Female%20Empowerment-1983832092950388739\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":null}],\"pageType\":\"latest_tuijian\",\"sectionDisplayName\":\"For You\"}]}]]}],\"$L40\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"38:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pc-container mobile-container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"!text-lg md:!text-3xl poppins-bold reconmmond-title\",\"children\":\" New Release Early Access\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{\"videoList\":[{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091788247006883842\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091788346747432961\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Beater Billionaire\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-beater-billionaire-2091788346747432961\",\"shortPlayLabels\":null,\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832036239818755\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1983832036239818755\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036302733315\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832036302733315\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036294344705\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832036294344705\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/ai_poster/2091788247006883842/a17de5103e244bc1a44c3e48e5baf220/2091806619866083329.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"groupShortPlayCover\":null,\"shotIntroduce\":\"Leonard, a trillionaire, drives a pink car to stay low-key. Humiliated at Austin Tech, he reveals his identity, bankrupts them, and backs a rival. He protects his wife Sofia with $50M, defeats the Victor family, and rescues her from kidnapper White. They drive off in their pink car—proof a true king needs no flash.\",\"totalEpisode\":50,\"isFinish\":null,\"sort\":null,\"isChase\":false},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090747167729352705\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090747232074170369\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Taboo Swap: Secrets Unleashed at Sea\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/taboo-swap-secrets-unleashed-at-sea-2090747232074170369\",\"shortPlayLabels\":null,\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092279300099\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Family Ethics\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Family%20Ethics-1983832092279300099\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091692097539\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Amnesia\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Amnesia-1983832091692097539\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/776339420_output.lin.png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"groupShortPlayCover\":null,\"shotIntroduce\":\"After a lifeboat accident aboard the Olympic, Princess Catherine wakes with \\\"amnesia.\\\" To hide his affair with Molly, her husband Frederick pushes her toward his son Julian, claiming Julian is her true husband. Between a possessive ex and a restrained crown prince, Catherine plays innocent as forbidden desire draws closer while she reclaims fate.\",\"totalEpisode\":47,\"isFinish\":null,\"sort\":null,\"isChase\":false},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090749110002483201\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090749166436843521\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Apex Cheetah's Sheep Sweetheart\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-apex-cheetahs-sheep-sweetheart-2090749166436843521\",\"shortPlayLabels\":null,\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832176002416642\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Second Chance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Second%20Chance-1983832176002416642\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832175285190658\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Love After Divorce\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Love%20After%20Divorce-1983832175285190658\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832175792701442\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Bitter Love\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Bitter%20Love-1983832175792701442\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/858341112_output.lin(4).png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"groupShortPlayCover\":null,\"shotIntroduce\":\"Billionaire cheetah CEO Caleb torments his sheep ex-lover, Maya, believing she betrayed him eight years ago. He has no idea the lowly dishwasher is secretly raising their critically ill 7-year-old daughter alone. Can the truth save their child and reignite their love?\",\"totalEpisode\":50,\"isFinish\":null,\"sort\":null,\"isChase\":false},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2090738095495942145\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2090738164987170818\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Merman King's Atonement\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-merman-kings-atonement-2090738164987170818\",\"shortPlayLabels\":null,\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091641765889\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Love After Divorce\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Love%20After%20Divorce-1983832091641765889\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091792760834\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Plot Twist\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Plot%20Twist-1983832091792760834\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/775092190_output.lin-6.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"groupShortPlayCover\":null,\"shotIntroduce\":\"Deceived by his tyrant father and a scheming princess, Deep Sea King Rowan nearly destroys his amnesiac grey-scaled wife Elena and their golden-scaled daughter Aliya. Upon learning the truth, he sacrifices his heart blood to cure Elena, slaughters their enemies, and the family reunites to abolish the merfolk caste law together.\",\"totalEpisode\":52,\"isFinish\":null,\"sort\":null,\"isChase\":false},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091700970385698817\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091701025255575554\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Wrong Me! I'm a Hidden Tycoon Mother\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/wrong-me-im-a-hidden-tycoon-mother-2091701025255575554\",\"shortPlayLabels\":null,\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832175603957762\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Family Drama\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Family%20Drama-1983832175603957762\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832175847227394\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Rich Family Feud\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Rich%20Family%20Feud-1983832175847227394\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832175884976131\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1983832175884976131\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/853032959_3-4(2).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"groupShortPlayCover\":null,\"shotIntroduce\":\"Hidden mogul Isolde raises son Leon in secret. Bullied by ex Edmund, saved by Meridian CEO Marcus, love blooms. Edmund plots to humiliate them at a gala, seize custody, and force Leon's marrow for his love child. Marcus renounces his billion-dollar inheritance. Pushed too far, Isolde reveals herself, crushes the plot, and accepts his proposal.\",\"totalEpisode\":15,\"isFinish\":null,\"sort\":null,\"isChase\":false},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2056565813161623554\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2056565856157433857\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Rejected, Now a Phoenix Princess\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/rejected-now-a-phoenix-princess-2056565856157433857\",\"shortPlayLabels\":null,\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091901812738\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Karma\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma-1983832091901812738\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"sort\":null,\"levelType\":null,\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/800743259_output.lin-2.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"groupShortPlayCover\":null,\"shotIntroduce\":\"Daisy, a Phoenix princess raised in slums, couldn't transform and was mocked. Her healing tears saved Dragon Prince Aaron, who made her his fiancée. But his love was a lie—on their wedding day, he humiliated her publicly. Suddenly, the Phoenix King and Queen arrived, declaring Daisy the sole heir. A court intrigue unfolded. To protect all she cherished, Daisy awakened her Phoenix blood and rose as a true powerhouse.\",\"totalEpisode\":50,\"isFinish\":null,\"sort\":null,\"isChase\":false}],\"pageType\":\"new_releases\",\"sectionDisplayName\":\" New Release Early Access\"}]}]]}],\"$L41\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"42:I[55539,[\"8026\",\"static/chunks/8026-fdd01cef9ed9fcad.js\",\"1356\",\"static/chunks/1356-497180fb2a2b715f.js\",\"5604\",\"static/chunks/5604-cb71f96ffe3b244d.js\",\"5481\",\"static/chunks/5481-68517c0c75307f2a.js\",\"4909\",\"static/chunks/4909-472194aeb0cec234.js\",\"6600\",\"static/chunks/6600-938d05f4f11e6e45.js\",\"763\",\"static/chunks/763-40f1211051022861.js\",\"5751\",\"static/chu